The likely root cause of this issue is related to how the comparison is done between fractions with limited precision. The comparison logic may not take into account the possibility of fractions being different but evaluating to the same double value.

## Inspection of relevant code snippet
Let's inspect the `compareTo` method in the `Fraction` class to understand how the comparison logic is implemented.

```java
public int compareTo(Fraction other) {
    if (this == other) {
        return 0;
